action,x,y,origin,button,key,micros,note,platform
# P92 on Windows, WinUIBackend, run with SCUI_P92_MENU=1 (standard menus on): the Edit menu's
# standard items act on the text field through WinUIBackend+StandardCommands.swift, and the
# CommandGroup(after:) items sit after the standard ones they name.
# Measured 2026-10-19 with UIA on the open menu, main-window DIPs at 125% (window 640 wide):
# Edit at (201, 50); items at x 264: Undo 86, Redo 118, AFTER-undoRedo 151, Cut 187, Copy 219,
# Paste 252, Delete 285, Select All 318. Field centre (314, 209), its text end clicked at (430, 209).
# The menu is clicked in main-window coordinates: Win32Synthesiser no longer takes a WinUI
# PopupWindowSiteBridge for a modal. Each item is hovered, then pressed and released 0.12 s apart:
# a plain click (press and release together) closed the menu without running the item (2026-10-19).
# Expected in p92-commands.log: field hellohello (Paste), field hello (Undo), field hellohello
# (Redo), command AFTER-undoRedo; on screen "last command: AFTER-undoRedo".
# P92(Windows,WinUIBackend,SCUI_P92_MENU=1):經 Edit 選單全選、複製、貼上 hello,再復原、重做，最後點 app 自己的項目。
# 選單項目以主視窗座標點擊。預期結果見上方英文。
sleep,,,,,,1500000,let P92 lay out,windows
click,314,209,frame,left,,,focus the field,windows
sleep,,,,,,400000,,windows
click,201,50,frame,left,,,open Edit,windows
sleep,,,,,,700000,,windows
